DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
26640::$$$message_0197_0000_0000$$$::Everyone is taking turns using the bath.[lr]::
26641::$$$message_0197_0000_0001$$$::I do some light training with Saber to help my digestion.[lr]::
26642::$$$message_0197_0000_0002$$$::I'm doing it for exercise, not competition, so I'm not fighting with Archer's dual sword style. I'm just using a single shinai.[lr]::
26643::$$$message_0197_0000_0003$$$::Saber isn't finishing me in one hit as usual, but pointing out my flaws at a relatively leisurely pace.::
26644::$$$message_0197_0001_0000$$$::"You're still too open when you raise your sword above your head.[lr]::
26645::$$$message_0197_0001_0001$$$::Try to address that in the future."::
26646::$$$message_0197_0002_0000$$$::"Relatively" being the operative word. She still knocks me to the ground as soon as she points out my mistakes.::
26647::$$$message_0197_0003_0000$$$::"Ngh, I'll be careful..."[lr]::
26648::$$$message_0197_0003_0001$$$::I rub the painful spot on my chest, stand up, and take a stance again.[lr]::
26649::$$$message_0197_0003_0002$$$::"Good. But you are becoming more skilled each day. Keep up that pace."[lr]::
26650::$$$message_0197_0003_0003$$$::Saber looks oddly happy.::
26651::$$$message_0197_0004_0000$$$::"You look like you're enjoying this, Saber."[lr]::
26652::$$$message_0197_0004_0001$$$::"Yes, Shirou. Your growth is apparent, if gradual. Nothing could make me happier as your swordsmanship trainer."[lr]::
26653::$$$message_0197_0004_0002$$$::...I see.[lr]::
26654::$$$message_0197_0004_0003$$$::Hearing that from my mentor makes me want to try harder as her pupil.::
26655::$$$message_0197_0005_0000$$$::"Let's keep going a little longer.[lr]::
26656::$$$message_0197_0005_0001$$$::...I've got a hidden technique up my sleeve. I didn't mean to show it to you yet, but..."[lr]::
26657::$$$message_0197_0005_0002$$$::I find myself wanting to impress my earnest, thoughtful mentor.::
26658::$$$message_0197_0006_0000$$$::"...? Very well. Let's start again, Shirou."[lr]::
26659::$$$message_0197_0006_0001$$$::Saber quickly resets her stance.[lr]::
26660::$$$message_0197_0006_0002$$$::She's going to come at me like always without giving me a moment to rest, if she sees that I'm not moving!::
26661::$$$message_0197_0007_0000$$$::"Ngh, there...!"[lr]::
26662::$$$message_0197_0007_0001$$$::Instead of taking the attack head-on, I step to the side to trap my opponent, aiming an attack for her vitals...which she easily avoids.[lr]::
26663::$$$message_0197_0007_0002$$$::"...Aw, crud. I had never managed to pull it off that well, but you still defended against it..."[lr]::
26664::$$$message_0197_0007_0003$$$::My shoulders slump in disappointment.::
26665::$$$message_0197_0008_0000$$$::"...Shirou, what was that?"[lr]::
26666::$$$message_0197_0008_0001$$$::"Oh, my new shinai move?[lr]::
26667::$$$message_0197_0008_0002$$$::I wanted to surprise you, so I asked Ri..."[lr]::
26668::$$$message_0197_0008_0003$$$::...Uh, um.[lr]::
26669::$$$message_0197_0008_0004$$$::Is it just me, or does Saber look really mad?::
26670::$$$message_0197_0009_0000$$$::"S-Saber...?"[lr]::
26671::$$$message_0197_0009_0001$$$::"...It would be redundant for me to ask where you learned that.[lr]::
26672::$$$message_0197_0009_0002$$$::That was Rider's footwork and approach. When did you..."[lr]::
26673::$$$message_0197_0009_0003$$$::"Well, I asked Rider to train with me when you weren't home."[lr]::
26674::$$$message_0197_0009_0004$$$::"Of course, I don't have Rider's speed or technique, so it's just an imitation. No, it barely even counts as a reference.::
26675::$$$message_0197_0010_0000$$$::"I see. So you don't care who you train with. Right?[lr]::
26676::$$$message_0197_0010_0001$$$::Why, I seem to remember you imitating Archer's techniques as well."[lr]::
26677::$$$message_0197_0010_0002$$$::"...Saber?"[lr]::
26678::$$$message_0197_0010_0003$$$::"You have Rin to teach you magecraft, and me to teach you swordsmanship, and yet you're still this capricious.[lr]::
26679::$$$message_0197_0010_0004$$$::Still, I turned a blind eye to Archer. But now, you even go to Rider."::
26680::$$$message_0197_0011_0000$$$::"Hold on, Saber. Aren't you getting the wrong idea?"[lr]::
26681::$$$message_0197_0011_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
26682::$$$message_0197_0011_0002$$$::She isn't listening![lr]::
26683::$$$message_0197_0011_0003$$$::She steps forward powerfully. Saber's not messing around with that shinai.::
26684::$$$message_0197_0012_0000$$$::"...Very well, Shirou. Use two swords, or chains, or whatever you prefer.[lr]::
26685::$$$message_0197_0012_0001$$$::Tonight is a good opportunity to show you exactly whose fighting style is superior."[lr]::
26686::$$$message_0197_0012_0002$$$::"Um... I already know you're the strongest... Saber, are you mad that I trained with Rider?"::
26687::$$$message_0197_0013_0000$$$::"I wouldn't get upset over something like that.[lr]::
26688::$$$message_0197_0013_0001$$$::I just want to see the results of your training with someone who isn't me."[lr]::
26689::$$$message_0197_0013_0002$$$::She chuckles, and I think I hear her mutter that she suspects me of going to Lancer and Assassin, too.::
26690::$$$message_0197_0014_0000$$$::"Liar! You're getting ready to throw down for real!"[lr]::
26691::$$$message_0197_0014_0001$$$::"Yes. You must train the way you fight, after all.[lr]::
26692::$$$message_0197_0014_0002$$$::Prepare yourself, Shirou!"::
26693::$$$message_0197_0015_0000$$$::Takeaways from today's training: [lr]::
26694::$$$message_0197_0015_0001$$$::First, Saber is really strong. I should try not to make her mad.::
26695::$$$message_0197_0016_0000$$$::Second...[lr]::
26696::$$$message_0197_0016_0001$$$::No matter what the reason is, don't switch sword styles. Show my respect for Saber.::
26697::$$$message_0197_0017_0000$$$::And so on.[lr]::
26698::$$$message_0197_0017_0001$$$::As my consciousness fades, I remind myself how terrifying she can be.::
926690::$$$message_9197_0014_0000$$$::"Liar! You're getting ready to throw down for real!"[r]::

